  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$I=\\int_3^6 \\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{9-x}+\\sqrt{x}} d x$\n\nApplying King's property\n$I=\\int_3^6 \\frac{\\sqrt{9-x}}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{9-x}} d x$\n\nAdding $2 \\mathrm{I}=\\int_3^6 \\mathrm{dx}=3 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{3}{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
